### ================================================================
### VitalTrack REST API - Complete Test Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api
### ================================================================


### ================================================================
###  EQUIPMENT ENDPOINTS
### ================================================================

### [GET] List All Equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/equipment/list
Accept: application/json

###

### [GET] Find Equipment by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/equipment/find/1
Accept: application/json

###

### [POST] Save New Equipment
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/equipment/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "MRI Scanner Pro",
  "serialNumber": "SN-MRI-2026",
  "purchaseDate": 1704067200000,
  "lastCalibrationDate": 1746057600000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### [PUT] Update Equipment by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/equipment/update/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "MRI Scanner Pro (Upgraded v2)",
  "serialNumber": "SN-MRI-2026-V2",
  "purchaseDate": 1704067200000,
  "lastCalibrationDate": 1746057600000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### [DELETE] Delete Equipment by ID  (change id as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/equipment/delete/5
Accept: application/json


### ================================================================
###  MEDICAL SUPPLY ENDPOINTS
### ================================================================

###

### [GET] List All Medical Supplies
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/supply/list
Accept: application/json

###

### [GET] Find Medical Supply by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/supply/find/1
Accept: application/json

###

### [POST] Save New Medical Supply
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/supply/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Surgical Gloves",
  "category": "Consumables",
  "quantity": 500,
  "unitOfMeasure": "Boxes",
  "expiryDate": 1830297600000,
  "reorderLevel": 50
}

###

### [PUT] Update Medical Supply by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/supply/update/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Surgical Gloves Premium",
  "category": "Consumables & Protective",
  "quantity": 450,
  "unitOfMeasure": "Boxes",
  "expiryDate": 1830297600000,
  "reorderLevel": 60
}

###

### [DELETE] Delete Medical Supply by ID  (change id as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/supply/delete/5
Accept: application/json


### ================================================================
###  MAINTENANCE LOG ENDPOINTS
### ================================================================

###

### [GET] List All Maintenance Logs
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/maintenance/list
Accept: application/json

###

### [GET] Find Maintenance Log by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/maintenance/find/1
Accept: application/json

###

### [POST] Save New Maintenance Log
### NOTE: equipmentId must match a real equipment record
### NOTE: technicianId must match a real technician record
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/maintenance/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "technicianId": 1,
  "serviceDate": 1746057600000,
  "actionTaken": "Full calibration and sensor replacement",
  "notes": "Replaced faulty pressure sensor. Equipment now fully operational."
}

###

### [PUT] Update Maintenance Log by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/maintenance/update/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "technicianId": 1,
  "serviceDate": 1746057600000,
  "actionTaken": "Full calibration, sensor replacement, and cleaning",
  "notes": "Upgraded pressure sensor and cleaned internal filters. Full testing pass."
}

###

### [DELETE] Delete Maintenance Log by ID  (change id as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/maintenance/delete/5
Accept: application/json


### ================================================================
###  NURSE ENDPOINTS
### ================================================================

###

### [GET] List All Nurses
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/nurse/list
Accept: application/json

###

### [GET] Find Nurse by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/nurse/find/1
Accept: application/json

###

### [POST] Register New Nurse
### NOTE: A temp password will be auto-generated and emailed to the nurse
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/nurse/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Mwangi",
  "specialization": "ICU",
  "contactInfo": "+254712345678",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "email": "jane.mwangi@hospital.com"
}

###

### [PUT] Update Nurse Details by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/nurse/update/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Mwangi-Kamau",
  "specialization": "Emergency ICU",
  "contactInfo": "+254712345679",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "email": "jane.mwangi@hospital.com"
}

###

### [DELETE] Delete Nurse by ID  (change id as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/nurse/delete/5
Accept: application/json


